        "approach": "Retained the initialized unguarded-correction candidate and compared it with matched guarded, no-correction, and fixed-mixture controls on 100 fresh paired seeds across four rule conditions and two phase lengths. Added switch-distance diagnostics for soft assignment error, memory error, and correction magnitude. The required offline tests passed.",
